    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Mother Sallow</h2><p>A contract-minded hag who stole Mara Vale seven years ago, though only a few days passed for the child. She claims Edric Vale owes payment after promising to return Mara home.</p><p><strong>Combat role:</strong> controller and mobile boss. Use saving-throw powers to pressure the party while the Hollowoak Guardian controls space. At 30 hit points or fewer, she offers to release Edric and Mara in exchange for safe passage.</p>",
