      "name": "Legendary Actions (2/round)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-star-pentagon-magenta.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Mother Sallow can take two Legendary Actions each round, one at a time at the end of another creature's turn. She regains them at the start of her turn.</p><ul><li><strong>Scuttle.</strong> Move up to half her Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</li><li><strong>Painful Recollection.</strong> One creature within 60 feet makes a DC 16 Wisdom save. On a failure it takes 2d8 Psychic damage and cannot take Reactions until the start of its next turn.</li><li><strong>Call the Roots (Costs 2).</strong> One creature on the ground within 60 feet makes a DC 16 Dexterity save. On a failure it takes 2d6 Bludgeoning damage and falls Prone.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
