      "name": "Memory-Bound Power",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/containers/bags/sack-simple-leather-brown.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Three Memory Bundles sustain parts of Mother Sallow's power.</p><ol><li><strong>First bundle:</strong> remove one unused Legendary Resistance and refresh The Weight of Memory.</li><li><strong>Second bundle:</strong> disable Step Between Stories.</li><li><strong>Third bundle:</strong> disable Magic Resistance.</li></ol><p>If all three bundles are opened, Mara's memories return and Mother Sallow's claim over Edric ends.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
